{title: Amazing Grace}
{artist: John Newton}
{genre: Hymn}
{pair: nagateun-joein}
{flow: Response}
{key: G}
{tempo: 76}
{time: 3/4}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 305장}
{title_ko: 나 같은 죄인 살리신}
{score: amazing-grace.abc}
# Add reference/practice videos like this (URL first, then an optional label):
